== Change float-conversions (CANON-8): T(F) into an integer type truncates
== toward zero, and a value outside T stops the program (kind 8).
Main :
    Value := 255.9
    PutLn(Byte(Value))
    Value += 1.0
    PutLn(Byte(Value))
;
